### Create Account
POST http://localhost:8107/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner": "John Doe",
  "initialBalance": 1000
}

> {% client.global.set("accountId", response.body); %}

### Deposit Money
POST http://localhost:8107/accounts/{{accountId}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500
}

### Withdraw Money
POST http://localhost:8107/accounts/{{accountId}}/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 200
}

### Get Account
GET http://localhost:8107/accounts/{{accountId}}
